  "description": "Roslyn analyzer for C# typography: flags en/em dashes (CTYED001, U+2013 / U+2014), typographic quotation marks (CTYQM001), typographic apostrophes (CTYAP001, U+2019), horizontal ellipsis (CTYEL001, U+2026), and minus sign (CTYMN001, U+2212) in source and matching project files. Includes minus Excludes plus AdditionalExcludes; defaults are overwriteable MSBuild properties.",
