  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 (2026-09-19)\n\n - Initial release.\n - CTYED001 flags en dash (U+2013) and em dash (U+2014).\n - CTYQM001 flags typographic quotation marks (curly quotes and guillemets).\n - CTYAP001 flags typographic apostrophe / closing single quotation mark (U+2019).\n - CTYEL001 flags horizontal ellipsis (U+2026).\n - CTYMN001 flags minus sign (U+2212).\n - ASCII hyphen, quotes, apostrophe, and periods stay silent.\n - Scans C# and matching extra files (Includes minus Excludes plus AdditionalExcludes).\n - Default severity is warning; set warning, error, message, or off per analyzer.",
